{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/3e08423ab6dd5bac2e25d5179e7e4d93.avif?t=1768565756\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras_big/3e08423ab6dd5bac2e25d5179e7e4d93.avif?t=1768565756 width=800 height=83 /></span>Manage resources while surviving and outrunning the impending storm chasing after you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/8d3c0b01d73e03f2f8392ef59a84e4e2.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/8d3c0b01d73e03f2f8392ef59a84e4e2.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/8d3c0b01d73e03f2f8392ef59a84e4e2.mp4?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/527ff68c5e8fd5b4041713068719efd6.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=800 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/527ff68c5e8fd5b4041713068719efd6.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/527ff68c5e8fd5b4041713068719efd6.mp4?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Fight blizzards and fiery tornadoes. Can you find ways to neutralize them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/14c3303e329da778cda1b41b3082db45.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/14c3303e329da778cda1b41b3082db45.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/14c3303e329da778cda1b41b3082db45.mp4?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build shields to protect your structures, or place turrets to go on the offense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/1e0ffd2a380b4ec7540adb327f369a3b.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/1e0ffd2a380b4ec7540adb327f369a3b.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/1e0ffd2a380b4ec7540adb327f369a3b.mp4?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/ff2d5f36c42dc63c737de8fee4da4551.avif?t=1768565756\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras_big/ff2d5f36c42dc63c737de8fee4da4551.avif?t=1768565756 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settlers are the lifeblood of your bridge settlement, operating buildings to ensure resources flow. Keep them fed, happy, and healthy, and assign specialized roles like farmers, scientists, or engineers to boost key structures. The bridge is more than a crossing\u2014it\u2019s a thriving community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/dc327498db97502171ddc8f87d1379d7.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/dc327498db97502171ddc8f87d1379d7.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/dc327498db97502171ddc8f87d1379d7.mp4?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/86a685f31110f13141074bdc83c01db2.avif?t=1768565756\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras_big/86a685f31110f13141074bdc83c01db2.avif?t=1768565756 width=800 height=83 /></span>Losing and restarting is expected! Permanent upgrades means you get stronger and progress further every time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/78e229bb2852839ff32b0bc4ffebe629.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/78e229bb2852839ff32b0bc4ffebe629.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/78e229bb2852839ff32b0bc4ffebe629.mp4?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/f879f3efe16877a455b444abd71341f1.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=616 height=76 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/f879f3efe16877a455b444abd71341f1.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/f879f3efe16877a455b444abd71341f1.mp4?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's 5 unicorns or a variety of mammals, amass your favorite pets to join you, each giving unique buffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/05e4269febcf8267055a369727251d51.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/05e4269febcf8267055a369727251d51.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/05e4269febcf8267055a369727251d51.mp4?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/1c3fe284576bb79aa9ed38193ae4afb0.avif?t=1768565756\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras_big/1c3fe284576bb79aa9ed38193ae4afb0.avif?t=1768565756 width=800 height=83 /></span>Navigate different biomes to uncover clues to the storm\u2019s origins. Each biome has its own unique mechanics:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find ways to beat cold temperatures in the tundra</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy helicopters on expeditions in the sky</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine scraps to manufacture repair bots underwater</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/83b56f521a376b8011405dc69deb8317.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/83b56f521a376b8011405dc69deb8317.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/83b56f521a376b8011405dc69deb8317.mp4?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/ab07aa0d70bf473a3a2b320040d1eeaa.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=616 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/ab07aa0d70bf473a3a2b320040d1eeaa.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/ab07aa0d70bf473a3a2b320040d1eeaa.mp4?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn cosmetics ranging from glowing hair to fancy accessories! As you progress, unlock traits that offer bonuses like extra starting resources or faster building production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/14cb42c7e29b718c934b0359b09e8623.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/14cb42c7e29b718c934b0359b09e8623.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/14cb42c7e29b718c934b0359b09e8623.mp4?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/242a0c19d6f6aba61368e6d015c08d38.avif?t=1768565756\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras_big/242a0c19d6f6aba61368e6d015c08d38.avif?t=1768565756 width=800 height=83 /></span>Between runs, take your time to build your own peaceful island, free from disasters. Use resources earned  to create your dream, humble abode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/440a9bb03954aae59ee215292af478e2.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/440a9bb03954aae59ee215292af478e2.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/440a9bb03954aae59ee215292af478e2.mp4?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/c4e4d9eecafeec217502614548f2b209.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/c4e4d9eecafeec217502614548f2b209.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/c4e4d9eecafeec217502614548f2b209.mp4?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock cosmetics to stylize your bridge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/3a447073dab65f26f8385dbdd3b0c21e.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/3a447073dab65f26f8385dbdd3b0c21e.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/3a447073dab65f26f8385dbdd3b0c21e.mp4?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3362750?t=1768565756","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3362750?t=1768565756","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/c1ac84a2ddf0282982dba7d3a75e1a24bdea6d2e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768565756","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/c1ac84a2ddf0282982dba7d3a75e1a24bdea6d2e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768565756","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3366680,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Join us on Discord!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/3c470d99cedf38617a38d5be27596d21.avif?t=1768565756\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras_big/3c470d99cedf38617a38d5be27596d21.avif?t=1768565756 width=800 height=163 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/3e08423ab6dd5bac2e25d5179e7e4d93.avif?t=1768565756\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras_big/3e08423ab6dd5bac2e25d5179e7e4d93.avif?t=1768565756 width=800 height=83 /></span>Manage resources while surviving and outrunning the impending storm chasing after you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/8d3c0b01d73e03f2f8392ef59a84e4e2.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/8d3c0b01d73e03f2f8392ef59a84e4e2.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/8d3c0b01d73e03f2f8392ef59a84e4e2.mp4?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/527ff68c5e8fd5b4041713068719efd6.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=800 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/527ff68c5e8fd5b4041713068719efd6.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/527ff68c5e8fd5b4041713068719efd6.mp4?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Fight blizzards and fiery tornadoes. Can you find ways to neutralize them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/14c3303e329da778cda1b41b3082db45.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/14c3303e329da778cda1b41b3082db45.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/14c3303e329da778cda1b41b3082db45.mp4?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build shields to protect your structures, or place turrets to go on the offense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/1e0ffd2a380b4ec7540adb327f369a3b.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/1e0ffd2a380b4ec7540adb327f369a3b.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/1e0ffd2a380b4ec7540adb327f369a3b.mp4?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/ff2d5f36c42dc63c737de8fee4da4551.avif?t=1768565756\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras_big/ff2d5f36c42dc63c737de8fee4da4551.avif?t=1768565756 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settlers are the lifeblood of your bridge settlement, operating buildings to ensure resources flow. Keep them fed, happy, and healthy, and assign specialized roles like farmers, scientists, or engineers to boost key structures. The bridge is more than a crossing\u2014it\u2019s a thriving community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/dc327498db97502171ddc8f87d1379d7.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/dc327498db97502171ddc8f87d1379d7.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/dc327498db97502171ddc8f87d1379d7.mp4?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/86a685f31110f13141074bdc83c01db2.avif?t=1768565756\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras_big/86a685f31110f13141074bdc83c01db2.avif?t=1768565756 width=800 height=83 /></span>Losing and restarting is expected! Permanent upgrades means you get stronger and progress further every time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/78e229bb2852839ff32b0bc4ffebe629.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/78e229bb2852839ff32b0bc4ffebe629.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/78e229bb2852839ff32b0bc4ffebe629.mp4?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/f879f3efe16877a455b444abd71341f1.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=616 height=76 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/f879f3efe16877a455b444abd71341f1.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/f879f3efe16877a455b444abd71341f1.mp4?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's 5 unicorns or a variety of mammals, amass your favorite pets to join you, each giving unique buffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/05e4269febcf8267055a369727251d51.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/05e4269febcf8267055a369727251d51.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/05e4269febcf8267055a369727251d51.mp4?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/1c3fe284576bb79aa9ed38193ae4afb0.avif?t=1768565756\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras_big/1c3fe284576bb79aa9ed38193ae4afb0.avif?t=1768565756 width=800 height=83 /></span>Navigate different biomes to uncover clues to the storm\u2019s origins. Each biome has its own unique mechanics:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find ways to beat cold temperatures in the tundra</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy helicopters on expeditions in the sky</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine scraps to manufacture repair bots underwater</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/83b56f521a376b8011405dc69deb8317.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/83b56f521a376b8011405dc69deb8317.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/83b56f521a376b8011405dc69deb8317.mp4?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/ab07aa0d70bf473a3a2b320040d1eeaa.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=616 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/ab07aa0d70bf473a3a2b320040d1eeaa.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/ab07aa0d70bf473a3a2b320040d1eeaa.mp4?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn cosmetics ranging from glowing hair to fancy accessories! As you progress, unlock traits that offer bonuses like extra starting resources or faster building production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/14cb42c7e29b718c934b0359b09e8623.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/14cb42c7e29b718c934b0359b09e8623.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/14cb42c7e29b718c934b0359b09e8623.mp4?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/242a0c19d6f6aba61368e6d015c08d38.avif?t=1768565756\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras_big/242a0c19d6f6aba61368e6d015c08d38.avif?t=1768565756 width=800 height=83 /></span>Between runs, take your time to build your own peaceful island, free from disasters. Use resources earned  to create your dream, humble abode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/440a9bb03954aae59ee215292af478e2.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/440a9bb03954aae59ee215292af478e2.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/440a9bb03954aae59ee215292af478e2.mp4?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/c4e4d9eecafeec217502614548f2b209.poster.avif?t=1768565756\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362750/extras/c4e4d9eecafeec217502614548f2b209.webm?t=1768565756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sour